I feel your pain.  Those magical eyes make playing semi-zen
attractive.

When you are hungry or worse, avoid control-T teleports at all cost.
Zapping yourself with a wand of teleport doesn't use any nutrition
points.

Breaking a wand of teleportation or wind followed by invoking the Eye
would have been the way to go, I think.

Spork was designed so that even very well prepared players can end up
getting slaughtered.  For a post-castle wizard, I would recommend:

1) Gauntlets of Force - they totally rule.
2) Spell of reflection.
3) Amulet of Lifesaving
4) Genocide locusts - they suck

And when things get tough - don't forget to pull your full healing and
cursed scroll of teleport out of your bag BEFORE it's too late.


